Redis 7.2.16 pub/sub tests: wait for no-argument unsubscribe acknowledgments.
The upstream helpers read one reply per supplied name, so no names means no
reply is read. Keep each wire command argument-free and consume its known
memberships before another connection relies on removal. Apply to Firn and
Redis reference runs alike; retire when the pinned suite includes these waits.

Sources:
https://github.com/redis/redis/blob/7.2.16/tests/unit/pubsub.tcl
https://github.com/redis/redis/blob/7.2.16/tests/unit/pubsubshard.tcl

